Z||000098||Archie||12-25-2001||11:36 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by fieroX:<BR><B> <BR>If you want to think that.  Bring on whatever you got. Ill put up a $6000 car (total price, wheels, tires, paint, interior, engine everything) against whatever you got.  Late.<P></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>People here have been trying to politely tell you something but you haven't caught on yet. So sooner or later someone has to say this to you in words that you can understand.<P>I mean no offense by this, but I think what they are trying to tell you is that you should at least get your car put together before you start wanting to race everybody.<P>We see people on here all the time talking about everything their car is gonna do. But by the time they get their car finished we hardly ever hear from them again.<P>Best of luck building your car and I hope it comes out as well as you expect. But do us all a favor..... try to get some work done on the car in between your sessions on here bragging about it.<P>Happy Holidays<P>Archie<P>------------------<BR>Just how fast do you want to go?||||reg||1
